<%# Add a line here for each change of a rule. Newest first. %>
<section aria-labelledby="<%= guideline_anchor(:changelog) %>">
  <h2 id="<%= guideline_anchor(:changelog) %>">9. Changes to these guidelines</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <time datetime="2026-09-26">26 September 2026</time>: Some specification fields now ask
      <b>"Measured at"</b> &mdash; the condition under which the value was measured. New rules for
      this field, and a rule that weight, dimensions and SPL are for one piece.
    </li>
    <li>
      <time datetime="2026-09-22">22 September 2026</time>: The guidelines are now on one page.
      New rules for sources, duplicates, language, objectivity, specifications and descriptions.
      Prices are now entered in the currency in which they were published, without conversion.
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
